# 00. Basic

This section covers the fundamental background knowledge required for research in model compression, efficient AI systems, and hardware-aware deep learning.

The main topics are:

- Linear Algebra
- Probability & Statistics
- Computer Architecture

---

## 1. Linear Algebra

Core mathematical concepts for understanding neural networks, optimization, matrix operations, and model compression.

### Topics

- Vectors and vector spaces
- Linear independence
- Basis and dimension
- Matrix operations
- Rank
- Linear transformations
- Orthogonality
- Eigenvalues and eigenvectors
- Diagonalization
- Positive definite matrices
- Singular Value Decomposition (SVD)
- Quadratic forms
- Matrix norms

